  {
    "start": 1304.88,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "catch them."
  },
  {
    "start": 1310.72,
    "duration": 4.72,
    "text": "No, no, no. A red light. Please wait."
  },
  {
    "start": 1315.44,
    "duration": 6.28,
    "text": "Excuse me. Please let me pass. My son."
  },
  {
    "start": 1325.76,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "No, I lost them."
  },
  {
    "start": 1329.12,
    "duration": 3.559,
    "text": "Where did it go?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1333.039,
    "duration": 1.281,
    "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1334.32,
    "duration": 4.239,
    "text": "My little boy's ball. It"
  },
  {
    "start": 1338.559,
    "duration": 4.321,
    "text": "It fell out. The truck went right. The"
  },
  {
    "start": 1342.88,
    "duration": 3.52,
    "text": "truck went right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1346.4,
    "duration": 3.759,
    "text": "I know it. I'm coming, Leo. Don't be"
  },
  {
    "start": 1350.159,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "scared."
  },
  {
    "start": 1353.36,
    "duration": 2.505,
    "text": "Help."
  },
  {
    "start": 1355.865,
    "duration": 0.934,
    "text": "[panting]"
  },
  {
    "start": 1356.799,
    "duration": 2.481,
    "text": "I need help."
  },
  {
    "start": 1359.28,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "A police officer. Thank goodness."
  },
  {
    "start": 1362.08,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "Officer, please help. My little boy is"
  },
  {
    "start": 1365.2,
    "duration": 1.68,
    "text": "trapped in a blue truck."
  },
  {
    "start": 1366.88,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": ">> We have an emergency. We need to stop a"
  },
  {
    "start": 1369.44,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "BLUE TRUCK RIGHT NOW."
  },
  {
    "start": 1372.72,
    "duration": 5.199,
    "text": ">> Please hurry, sir. He must be so scared."
  },
  {
    "start": 1377.919,
    "duration": 3.601,
    "text": "Look, there's the blue truck. Pull over."
  },
  {
    "start": 1381.52,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": "Stop your truck right now."
  },
  {
    "start": 1384.08,
    "duration": 3.225,
    "text": ">> Rock and roll, baby."
  },
  {
    "start": 1387.305,
    "duration": 0.775,
    "text": "[music]"
  },
  {
    "start": 1388.08,
    "duration": 1.68,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 1389.76,
    "duration": 5.88,
    "text": ">> He can't hear us. Wait, I will stop him."
  },
  {
    "start": 1395.679,
    "duration": 1.521,
    "text": ">> Officer,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1397.2,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "is something wrong? I was just driving."
  },
  {
    "start": 1402.0,
    "duration": 2.64,
    "text": "Open the back. My son is in there."
  },
  {
    "start": 1404.64,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "Hurry."
  },
  {
    "start": 1408.4,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": ">> Daddy, you are here."
  },
  {
    "start": 1412.0,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "Daddy,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1414.48,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "it was so dark and scary."
  },
  {
    "start": 1418.08,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": ">> Oh, my brave boy."
  },
  {
    "start": 1420.64,
    "duration": 2.08,
    "text": "I've got you."
  },
  {
    "start": 1422.72,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "You are safe [music] now."
  },
  {
    "start": 1427.679,
    "duration": 4.721,
    "text": ">> Leo, where is my Leo? Mommy, look. Daddy"
  },
  {
    "start": 1432.4,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "found him."
  },
  {
    "start": 1434.88,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": ">> Oh, my sweet baby. [laughter]"
  },
  {
    "start": 1438.08,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "We were so worried about you."
  },
  {
    "start": 1441.12,
    "duration": 3.919,
    "text": ">> Parents, always watch your kids."
  },
  {
    "start": 1445.039,
    "duration": 2.241,
    "text": ">> Please [music] never take your eyes off"
  },
  {
    "start": 1447.28,
    "duration": 5.44,
    "text": "them. And kids never play near or hide"
  },
  {
    "start": 1452.72,
    "duration": 2.079,
    "text": "in trucks."
  },
  {
    "start": 1454.799,
    "duration": 3.281,
    "text": ">> That's right. It is not fun at all. If"
  },
  {
    "start": 1458.08,
    "duration": 2.0,
    "text": "you like our story today, [music] please"
  },
  {
    "start": 1460.08,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": "like, share, and subscribe."
  },
  {
    "start": 1462.64,
    "duration": 1.6,
    "text": ">> Bye-bye."
  },
  {
    "start": 1464.24,
    "duration": 3.799,
    "text": ">> See you [music] next time."
  }
]
